  "content": {
    "description": [
      [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Research and interviews with Cecconi Simone’s founding partners, led by "
            },
            {
              "type": "external-link",
              "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/terry-lau-b4b98a/",
              "label": "Terry Lau"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": ", surfaced a pivotal moment: although "
            },
            {
              "type": "external-link",
              "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/elaine-cecconi-62264736/",
              "label": "Elaine Cecconi"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "external-link",
              "href": "https://www.worldinteriorsnewsawards.com/anna-simone",
              "label": "Anna Simone"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": " were considering retirement, they remained committed to mentoring the next generation of interior designers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The brand strategy rests on four philosophical pillars that reflect Cecconi Simone’s design approach and support a forward-looking identity for emerging designers and prospective clients."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
